#: im-config:157
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"The $IM_CONFIG_XINPUTRC_TYPE has been manually modified.\n"
"Remove the $IM_CONFIG_XINPUTRC_TYPE $IM_CONFIG_XINPUTRC manually to use im-"
"config.\n"
"$IM_CONFIG_RTFM"
msgstr ""
